{"version": 2, "width": 150, "height": 42, "timestamp": 1793473247, "title": "Ciphraud: encrypted LR round trip (real run)", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[1.172668, "o", "Ciphraud - encrypted fraud scoring, logistic regression (20 features, 16-bit), one transaction\r\n"]
[1.173467, "o", "Client and server are two separate processes talking over loopback HTTP.\r\nPaced for viewing: 1.5 s pauses are added between sections, outside every timed operation.\r\n"]
[2.672317, "o", "\r\n== 1. Start the inference server (holds the compiled model, never a secret key)\r\n"]
[20.555967, "o", "server pid 424 listening on http://127.0.0.1:42971; model lr_top20_bits16 loaded\r\n"]
[22.054678, "o", "\r\n== 2. Client side: load client artifact, generate keys\r\n"]
[28.84486, "o", "client artifact sha256 matches the served circuit: True\r\n"]
[28.847386, "o", "secret + evaluation keys generated on the CLIENT in 0.00 s (secret key stays in client memory)\r\n"]
[28.848329, "o", "evaluation (public) keys: 64 bytes, sha256 c69012816d87dcda...\r\n"]
[28.986139, "o", "uploaded evaluation keys only; server key_id c69012816d87dcda... (server never receives the secret key)\r\n"]
[30.486274, "o", "\r\n== 3. Client side: preprocess, quantize, encrypt one transaction\r\n"]
[31.659736, "o", "plaintext transaction: validation row 32148, 20 raw features (stays on the client)\r\n"]
[31.669526, "o", "quantized input integers (client-only): [-31641, -31668, -31632, -31702, -31650, -31654, -31119, -32175, -31636, -31720, -31294, -31372, -31536, -31677, -31650, -31908, -31680, -31630, -31139, -31948]\r\n"]
[31.669966, "o", "encrypted in 9.1 ms -> ciphertext 744 bytes, sha256 b0577cd8b4bdfd62...\r\n"]
[33.169714, "o", "\r\n== 4. Send ciphertext; the server computes on it without decrypting\r\n"]
[33.323146, "o", "request body 744 bytes (ciphertext only), response 17,920 bytes (still encrypted)\r\n"]
[34.823443, "o", "server FHE evaluation: 137.7 ms (this is the first, cold request on this server)\r\n"]
[36.323577, "o", "\r\n== 5. Client side: decrypt and decide\r\n"]
[36.324916, "o", "decrypted integer(s): [-214667949]\r\nfraud probability 0.206024, threshold 0.708641 -> decision: not fraud\r\n"]
[37.825037, "o", "\r\n== 6. Check against the plaintext-quantized model and the recorded Phase 10 reference\r\n"]
[37.825371, "o", "reference integers (clear quantized model): [-214667949]\r\nequals clear-quantized model:      True\r\nequals Concrete simulation:        True\r\nequals recorded source-phase value: True\r\nEXACT INTEGER AGREEMENT: True\r\n"]
[39.325513, "o", "\r\n== 7. What crossed the wire (client-side audit of every request body)\r\n"]
[39.325533, "o", "POST   /v1/keys                               64 bytes  evaluation_keys\r\nPOST   /v1/infer                             744 bytes  input_ciphertext\r\nevery body is evaluation keys or an input ciphertext: True\r\n"]
[40.825658, "o", "\r\n== 8. Cleanup\r\n"]
[40.999362, "o", "server keys deleted; key still resident on server: False\r\n"]
[40.999443, "o", "\r\n"]
[41.000237, "o", "One request, one fixed validation row, loopback. A functional demonstration, not a benchmark.\r\n"]
[41.264623, "o", "server stopped (exit code -15)\r\n"]
